  class="border-y border-slate-200/80 bg-white py-20 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:py-24"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p
        class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-700 dark:text-brand-400"
      >
        Dúvidas frequentes
      </p>

      <h2
        class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Antes de começar.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        As principais informações sobre o período de teste e a assinatura.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 divide-y divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-800">
      <details class="group py-5 first:pt-0">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"
        >
          Preciso cadastrar cartão de crédito para testar?

          <span
            class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg
              width="16"
              height="16"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>

        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl pr-12 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Não. Você pode criar sua conta e usar o app gratuitamente por 7 dias sem
          cadastrar cartão de crédito.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"
        >
          O que acontece quando os 7 dias terminarem?

          <span
            class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg
              width="16"
              height="16"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>

        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl pr-12 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Ao final do período gratuito, você decide se deseja continuar usando o
          sistema por meio da assinatura do plano Essencial.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"
        >
          Posso cancelar a assinatura quando quiser?

          <span
            class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg
              width="16"
              height="16"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14"></path>
              <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>

        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl pr-12 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Sim. A assinatura pode ser cancelada a qualquer momento.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group py-5">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100"
